       "html": "<strong>(d)</strong>  <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></math>."
