       "html": "<math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math>, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math>, <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></math> y <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math> , <math display=\"inline\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></math> . Por tanto, <math display=\"block\"><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>b</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd columnalign=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center\"><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>a</mi></msub><mi>b</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo></mrow><mi>b</mi></msub><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></math>"
